#
# espos_formulas is C++ throughout, in the same Google style as espos_flow's
# graph headers -- 2-space indent, `Type* p`, 80 columns. clang-format uses
# the nearest file, so this one covers include/espos_formulas/; the umbrella
# header one level up is matched by the repository root .clang-format, which
# is why it is written to fit both.
---
Language: Cpp
BasedOnStyle: Google
# Include order is deliberate: the component's own headers first, then the
# espOS headers it depends on, then the system ones. Never reorder.
SortIncludes: Never
